From 9be8e551e7a104366329e2e2e38c26dafbcb2594 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:04:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] Add lifetime stats on the pause screen

Totals live in memory and are saved when pausing, finishing, every 30
seconds of play, and on dispose, so storage is not written every frame.
Also updates the README for ghost, achievements, lifetime stats and the
new settings.
